    "northern_trail": {
      "title": "Tracks in the Stone",
      "text": "Elara found footprints on the northern trail that simply stop. No marks on the rock, no sign of anyone turning back. Higher up we found a scout's lantern, and on the rocks above it their bedroll, a cold fire and their pack. One of the old survey markers has been snapped through. Beyond it, a stone carved with shapes I have never seen pulsed with light as I came near. Elara has marked it all on the map. Next: Orin, and proper surveying gear."
